EFF Short Wordlist #1
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Used in: apps/web/src/lib/wordlist.ts (the words generated passphrases are made of)

Source: "EFF's New Wordlists for Random Passphrases", Joseph Bonneau, Electronic Frontier Foundation, 2016.
        https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/07/new-wordlists-random-passphrases
        https://www.eff.org/files/2016/09/08/eff_short_wordlist_1.txt
Copyright Electronic Frontier Foundation.
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
         (as stated on EFF's copyright page, https://www.eff.org/copyright, checked 2026-11-15)

Changes made: the dice numbers were dropped and 261 of the 1,296 words were removed (screens for violent, sexual,
bodily, alcohol, drug and other distressing words, words easily confused with another, words phones autocorrect, and
"yo-yo" for its hyphen). 1,035 words remain, unchanged and
in the original order. EFF does not endorse Matra.

